---
import MainHead from '../components/MainHead.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
const views = [
  { id: 'home', label: 'Discover', desktop: '/assets/showbliz/showbliz-desktop.webp', mobile: '/assets/showbliz/showbliz-mobile-sep2026.webp', caption: 'A way into Miami’s live arts. By day, by format, by curiosity.' },
  { id: 'week', label: 'This week', desktop: '/assets/showbliz/showbliz-week-desktop.webp', mobile: '/assets/showbliz/showbliz-week-mobile-sep2026.webp', caption: 'One question, answered: what can I go and see this week?' },
];
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <MainHead title="Fede Bozo — Ideas into the world."
      description="Product designer, design engineer, and writer. I created ShowBliz from the first question to the live product. Here’s what I build and how I think."
      canonical="https://www.priisma.com/" image="https://www.priisma.com/assets/fede-portrait.jpeg" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#efefe8" />
  </head>
  <body class="fede">
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <Nav />
    <main id="main">
      <section id="showbliz" class="opening page-width" aria-labelledby="opening-title">
        <div class="opening-copy">
          <p class="eyeline">A personal project. Out in the world.</p>
          <h2 id="opening-title">I wanted <br>to see <em>a play.</em></h2>
          <p class="punchline">Apparently, first I needed <br>to build a platform.</p>
          <a class="inline-link story-link" href="#story">There’s a story here <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="product-stage">
          <div class="stage-top"><h2>ShowBliz<span class="sup">↗</span></h2><a href="https://showbliz.com/" class="visit-link">Visit the live product <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
          <div class="screens" id="product-preview">
            {views.map((view,i) => <div class="screen-pair" data-view={view.id} hidden={i !== 0}>
              <figure class="desktop-screen"><div class="window-label"><span>showbliz.com{view.id === 'week' ? '/this-week' : ''}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><img src={view.desktop} alt={`ShowBliz ${view.label.toLowerCase()} on desktop, showing real Miami theater listings`} width="1440" height="1000" loading={i===0?'eager':'lazy'} fetchpriority={i===0?'high':'auto'} /></figure>
              <figure class="mobile-screen"><img src={view.mobile} alt={`ShowBliz ${view.label.toLowerCase()} on mobile`} width="375" height="812" loading={i===0?'eager':'lazy'} /></figure>
            </div>)}
            <span class="screen-annotation" aria-hidden="true">Yes, it’s a real thing.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="preview-controls" data-enhancement hidden>
            <div role="group" aria-label="Choose a ShowBliz preview">{views.map((view,i)=><button type="button" data-preview={view.id} aria-pressed={i===0} aria-controls="product-preview">{view.label}</button>)}</div>
            <button class="enlarge" type="button" id="enlarge">View larger <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
          </div>
          <p class="preview-caption" id="preview-caption" aria-live="polite">{views[0].caption}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ownership"><p>From the first question to the live product.</p><p>Concept <span>→</span> Design <span>→</span> Engineering <span>→</span> Launch</p></div>
      </section>
      <section id="story" class="story page-width" aria-labelledby="story-title">
        <div class="story-origin"><p class="eyeline">Why it exists</p><h2 id="story-title">Miami had the shows.<br><em>Finding them was the work.</em></h2></div>
        <div class="story-detail"><p>Finding what was on meant looking everywhere. I wanted one place to discover this week’s shows and hear about what was coming.</p><p>So I created ShowBliz. For people who love the arts, whether they live in Miami or are just here for the weekend.</p><a class="inline-link" href="https://showbliz.com/">Find something worth going out for <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      </section>
      <section class="community" aria-labelledby="community-title"><div class="page-width community-inner"><p class="eyeline">The part I’m proudest of</p><h2 id="community-title">People are starting<br>to gather <em>around it.</em></h2><p>It started with something I wanted to find.<br>It’s becoming something we can share.</p></div></section>
      <section id="thinking" class="thinking page-width" aria-labelledby="thinking-title">
        <div class="section-label"><span class="eyeline">How I think</span><span class="eyeline">An ongoing practice</span></div>
        <h2 id="thinking-title"><span>“Everyone’s doing it”</span><br>leaves a lot <em>unanswered.</em></h2>
        <div class="thinking-body"><div class="questions"><p>What are we trying to make possible?</p><p>Who does it help?</p><p>What would we build if we stopped looking sideways?</p></div><div class="thinking-context"><p>Those questions shape how I work. I help teams decide what matters, give it form, and carry it through to something people can use.</p><p>Technology expands what we can make. We still have to decide what deserves to exist. And we get further when we think together.</p></div></div>
      </section>
      <section id="writing" class="writing page-width" aria-labelledby="writing-title">
        <div class="writing-intro"><p class="eyeline">Off screen / On paper</p><h2 id="writing-title">I’m writing <br>about this, too.</h2><p>Thinking for ourselves. Learning to build together. Imagination, empathy, and the decisions we still have to make as machines become capable of more.</p><a class="inline-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/fedebozo/">Follow my writing on LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        <article class="notebook"><div class="note-meta"><span class="eyeline">Ummaguma</span><span class="eyeline">Book in progress</span></div><h3>Don’t outsource<br>your <em>imagination.</em></h3><p>A competitor’s decision doesn’t tell you what your people need. Your team, your purpose, and your possibilities deserve their own questions.</p><details><summary>Read the working note <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="note-content"><p>“Everyone is doing AI” says something about everyone. It doesn’t explain what we should do, or why.</p><p>We can learn from other people without handing them our direction. Their work might open a possibility. Our job is to understand whether that possibility matters here.</p><p>Before asking how to do what they do, ask what we would build if they didn’t exist.</p><p class="note-credit">Adapted from my conversations for the book. Still being thought through.</p></div></details></article>
      </section>
      <section id="work" class="other-work page-width" aria-labelledby="work-title"><div><p class="eyeline">A little more evidence</p><h2 id="work-title">Other problems. <br>Same involvement.</h2></div><div class="work-list"><a href="/work/quotingbill"><div><h3>QuotingBill</h3><p>Recurring billing. From product design to front-end implementation.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/work/cigarwell"><div><h3>Cigarwell</h3><p>A platform for collectors. Product strategy, experience, and design system.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><details class="work-archive"><summary>Earlier work <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div><a href="/work/airtrfx">airTRFX / Aviation ↗</a><a href="/work/mchanywhere">MCH Anywhere / Healthcare ↗</a><a href="/work/godark">GoDark / Brand & web ↗</a></div></details></div></section>
      <section id="contact" class="contact page-width" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div class="person"><img src="/assets/fede-portrait.jpeg" alt="Fede Bozo" width="800" height="772" loading="lazy" /><p>Fede Bozo<br><span>Based in Miami.<br>Priisma is my imprint.</span></p></div><div class="invitation"><h2 id="contact-title">Have something<br>worth <em>figuring out?</em></h2><a class="contact-link" href="mailto:fede@priisma.com">Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="social" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/fedebozo/">LinkedIn ↗</a></div></section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
    <dialog id="preview-dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-title"><div class="dialog-top"><h2 id="dialog-title">ShowBliz / Product preview</h2><button id="close-preview" type="button" aria-label="Close product preview">Close ×</button></div><div class="dialog-options" role="group" aria-label="Preview device"><button type="button" data-device="desktop" aria-pressed="true">Desktop</button><button type="button" data-device="mobile" aria-pressed="false">Mobile</button></div><img id="large-preview" src={views[0].desktop} alt="ShowBliz desktop preview" width="1440" height="1000" loading="lazy"/><p class="capture-note">Actual product capture · September 2026 · <a href="https://showbliz.com/">Open ShowBliz ↗</a></p></dialog>
    <script define:vars={{views}}>
      // Enhancement only: product images, copy, links and notes work without JavaScript.
      const pairs = document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]');
      const choices = document.querySelectorAll('[data-preview]');
      const devices = document.querySelectorAll('[data-device]');
      const dialog = document.getElementById('preview-dialog');
      const large = document.getElementById('large-preview');
      let active = views[0];
      let device = 'desktop';
      const renderLarge = () => {
        large.src = active[device];
        large.alt = `ShowBliz ${active.label.toLowerCase()} on ${device}`;
        large.width = device === 'desktop' ? 1440 : 375;
        large.height = device === 'desktop' ? 1000 : 812;
        large.dataset.device = device;
      };
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-enhancement]').forEach(el => el.hidden = false);
      choices.forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
        active = views.find(view => view.id === button.dataset.preview);
        pairs.forEach(pair => pair.hidden = pair.dataset.view !== active.id);
        choices.forEach(choice => choice.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(choice === button)));
        document.getElementById('preview-caption').textContent = active.caption;
        renderLarge();
      }));
      devices.forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
        device = button.dataset.device;
        devices.forEach(choice => choice.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(choice === button)));
        renderLarge();
      }));
      document.getElementById('enlarge').addEventListener('click', () => { renderLarge(); dialog.showModal(); });
      document.getElementById('close-preview').addEventListener('click', () => dialog.close());
      dialog.addEventListener('click', event => { if(event.target === dialog) { const r=dialog.getBoundingClientRect(); if(event.clientX<r.left || event.clientX>r.right || event.clientY<r.top || event.clientY>r.bottom) dialog.close(); } });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
.fede{--serif:'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 'Mona Sans',Arial,sans-serif}
.fede :global(*){box-sizing:border-box}.fede :global([hidden]){display:none!important}.fede :global(h1),.fede :global(h2),.fede :global(h3){text-shadow:none}.fede :global(a){opacity:1;box-shadow:none;text-decoration:none}.fede :global(a:hover){text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}.fede :global(a:focus-visible),.fede :global(button:focus-visible),.fede :global(summary:focus-visible){outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:5px}.fede :global(::selection){background:var(--blue);color:white}.fede :global(button){font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.fede :global(figure){margin:0}.fede :global(em){font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400}.fede :global(section[id]){scroll-margin-top:24px}.eyeline{font:11px/1.4 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase}.inline-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;font-size:14px;border-bottom:1px solid;padding:5px 0}.inline-link span{color:var(--blue);font-size:20px}.skip{position:absolute;top:-100px;left:20px;padding:12px;background:var(--ink);color:white;z-index:10}.skip:focus{top:10px}
.opening{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.86fr 1.14fr;column-gap:5%;padding-top:45px}.opening-copy{padding-top:9px}.opening-copy .eyeline{margin-bottom:28px}#opening-title{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(72px,7.6vw,118px);letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:.9;margin:0}#opening-title em{white-space:nowrap;color:var(--blue)}.punchline{font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,28px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-top:26px}.story-link{margin-top:26px}.product-stage{min-width:0;padding-top:10px}.stage-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink);padding-bottom:13px}.stage-top h2{font-weight:750;font-size:29px;letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1}.sup{font-size:16px;vertical-align:top;margin-left:5px;color:var(--blue)}.visit-link{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}.screens{position:relative;padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:60px}.screen-pair{position:relative;padding-right:55px;animation:screen-in .45s ease both}.desktop-screen{border:1px solid var(--ink);background:#0c0c0c;box-shadow:0 14px 28px #12131016;transform:rotate(-2deg);position:relative}.window-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 12px;background:var(--paper);font:9px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--muted)}.desktop-screen img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.mobile-screen{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:-30px;width:24%;background:#0c0c0c;border:5px solid #161714;border-radius:17px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 24px #0003;transform:rotate(5deg)}.mobile-screen img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.screen-annotation{position:absolute;left:12px;bottom:13px;font:italic 23px var(--serif);transform:rotate(-5deg);color:var(--blue)}.preview-controls{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px}.preview-controls [role=group]{display:flex;gap:4px}.preview-controls button,.dialog-options button{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:7px 13px;font-size:12px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink)}.preview-controls button[aria-pressed=true],.dialog-options button[aria-pressed=true]{color:var(--paper);background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink)}.preview-controls .enlarge{border:0;padding-inline:0}.preview-caption{font-size:12px;min-height:36px;margin-top:12px;max-width:470px;color:var(--muted)}.ownership{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-block:1px solid var(--ink);padding:18px 0;margin-top:28px;font-size:12px}.ownership p:last-child{font:11px/1.5 ui-monospace,monospace}.ownership span{color:var(--blue);margin-inline:10px}
.story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10%;padding-block:66px}.story h2{font:400 clamp(32px,3.3vw,48px)/1.03 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-top:17px}.story-detail{padding-top:28px;max-width:510px}.story-detail p{margin-bottom:17px}.story-detail .inline-link{margin-top:5px}.community{background:var(--blue);color:var(--paper);padding-block:48px;overflow:hidden}.community-inner{position:relative;padding-left:24%}.community .eyeline{position:absolute;left:0;top:8px;max-width:150px}.community h2{font-size:clamp(38px,5.7vw,86px);font-weight:600;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.055em}.community h2 em{font-size:1.15em}.community-inner>p:last-child{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:25px;margin-left:40%}
.thinking{padding-block:78px}.section-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:17px}.thinking h2{font-size:clamp(36px,4.6vw,68px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:34px 0}.thinking h2>span{color:var(--muted)}.thinking h2 em{font-size:1.1em}.thinking-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10%;margin-top:42px}.questions p{font-size:clamp(18px,1.7vw,24px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.03em;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.questions p:first-child{padding-top:0}.thinking-context{max-width:510px}.thinking-context p+p{margin-top:20px}
.writing{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:10%;border-top:1px solid var(--ink);padding-block:60px}.writing-intro h2{font:400 clamp(42px,4.3vw,62px)/1 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:20px 0}.writing-intro>p:not(.eyeline){max-width:360px;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:20px}.notebook{border:1px solid var(--ink);padding:25px 30px 12px;align-self:start;box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--blue);transform:rotate(-1deg)}.note-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px}.note-meta .eyeline{font-size:10px}.notebook h3{font:400 clamp(38px,4vw,58px)/1 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:25px 0 20px}.notebook h3 em{color:var(--blue)}.notebook>p{font-size:15px;max-width:500px}.notebook details{margin-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}summary{cursor:pointer;padding-block:15px;font-size:13px;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}summary span{font-size:19px;line-height:1;transition:transform .2s}details[open]>summary span{transform:rotate(45deg)}.note-content p{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 16px}.note-content .note-credit{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:20px}
.other-work{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:10%;border-top:1px solid var(--ink);padding-block:48px}.other-work h2{font-size:25px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:600;margin-top:18px}.work-list>a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 0}.work-list>a:first-child{padding-top:0}.work-list h3{font-size:22px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.04em}.work-list p{font-size:14px;margin-top:7px;color:var(--muted);max-width:430px}.work-list>a>span{color:var(--blue);font-size:24px}.work-archive{margin-top:5px}.work-archive>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:15px;padding-bottom:10px;font-size:14px}
.contact{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:10%;padding-block:55px 65px;border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}.person{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px}.person img{width:106px;height:136px;object-fit:cover;filter:grayscale(1);transform:rotate(-3deg)}.person p{font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.person span{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;font:11px/1.5 ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--muted)}.invitation h2{font:400 clamp(40px,4.4vw,64px)/.98 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.025em}.contact-link{font-size:22px;display:inline-flex;gap:32px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--blue);padding-block:6px;margin-top:25px}.social{margin-left:28px;font-size:13px}
#preview-dialog{position:fixed;inset:0;margin:auto;width:min(1100px,94vw);max-height:92dvh;overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--ink);padding:20px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)}#preview-dialog::backdrop{background:#000b;backdrop-filter:blur(5px)}.dialog-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center}.dialog-top h2{font-size:16px;font-weight:600}.dialog-top button{padding:9px 14px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid var(--ink);background:var(--paper)}.dialog-options{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-block:18px}#large-preview{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--ink)}#large-preview[data-device=mobile]{width:min(390px,100%);margin-inline:auto}.capture-note{font-size:12px;padding-top:14px}.capture-note a{color:var(--blue)}
@keyframes screen-in{from{opacity:.65;transform:translateY(10px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
@supports(animation-timeline:view()){ @media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.community h2{animation:community-in linear both;animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% entry 100%}@keyframes community-in{from{transform:translateX(35px)}to{transform:translateX(0)}}}}
@media(min-width:1600px){.opening{padding-top:56px}.opening-copy{padding-top:24px}.screens{padding-top:38px}.ownership{margin-top:42px}}
@media(max-width:1050px){.opening{column-gap:4%;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;padding-top:30px}#opening-title{font-size:8.3vw}.opening-copy .eyeline{font-size:9px;margin-bottom:20px}.punchline{font-size:21px}.screen-pair{padding-right:35px}.mobile-screen{width:28%;border-width:4px}.stage-top h2{font-size:26px}.visit-link{font-size:9px}.ownership{font-size:11px}.ownership span{margin-inline:5px}.story{gap:7%;padding-block:46px}.community-inner{padding-left:21%}.community h2{font-size:6vw}.community .eyeline{max-width:120px}.thinking,.writing{padding-block:50px}.writing,.other-work,.contact{gap:7%}.notebook{padding:22px}.person{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.thinking-body{gap:7%}}
@media(max-width:700px){.opening{display:block;padding-top:28px}.opening-copy .eyeline{font-size:10px;margin-bottom:18px}#opening-title{font-size:clamp(68px,15vw,100px)}#opening-title br{display:none}.punchline{font-size:22px;line-height:1.15;margin-top:18px}.punchline br{display:none}.story-link{display:none}.product-stage{margin-top:32px;padding-top:0}.stage-top{padding-bottom:12px}.stage-top h2{font-size:27px}.visit-link{font-size:10px}.screens{padding-top:23px;padding-bottom:48px}.screen-pair{padding-right:43px}.mobile-screen{width:24%;bottom:-24px;border-width:3px;border-radius:10px}.window-label{font-size:7px;padding:5px 8px}.screen-annotation{font-size:21px;bottom:8px}.preview-controls button{font-size:11px;padding:6px 10px}.preview-caption{font-size:11px;min-height:0;margin-top:10px}.ownership{margin-top:24px;display:block;padding:14px 0}.ownership p:last-child{font-size:10px;margin-top:7px}.ownership span{margin-inline:6px}.story{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0;padding-block:36px}.story h2{font-size:38px}.story-detail{padding-top:22px}.story-detail p{font-size:15px}.community{padding-block:35px}.community-inner{padding-left:0}.community .eyeline{position:static;max-width:none;margin-bottom:24px}.community h2{font-size:clamp(38px,9vw,63px)}.community-inner>p:last-child{margin-left:15%;font-size:13px}.thinking{padding-block:40px}.section-label .eyeline{font-size:9px}.thinking h2{font-size:clamp(33px,7.6vw,48px);margin:25px 0}.thinking-body{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:25px}.questions p{font-size:19px}.thinking-context p{font-size:15px}.writing{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px;padding-block:36px}.writing-intro h2{font-size:44px}.writing-intro h2 br{display:none}.writing-intro>p:not(.eyeline){max-width:none}.notebook{margin-right:6px;padding:22px 20px 10px}.notebook h3{font-size:43px}.notebook>p{font-size:14px}.other-work{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px;padding-block:36px}.other-work h2{font-size:25px}.other-work h2 br{display:none}.contact{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px;padding-block:36px}.person{flex-direction:row;align-items:center}.person img{width:75px;height:90px}.person span{margin-top:4px}.invitation h2{font-size:49px}.dialog-top h2{font-size:13px}#preview-dialog{padding:14px}.capture-note{font-size:10px}}
@media(max-width:380px){.punchline{font-size:20px}.eyeline{font-size:10px}.ownership p:last-child{font-size:9px}.ownership span{margin-inline:3px}.preview-controls{gap:8px}.community h2{font-size:36px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.fede :global(*){animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
